Package: pi-phone-desktop
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, adb
Description: Mirror and desktop-mode your Android phone on a Raspberry Pi
 pi-phone-desktop bundles scrcpy (screen mirroring and control for Android
 devices) together with ready-to-use Accessories launchers for plain phone
 mirroring and for Android's native Desktop Mode (Android 16 and later),
 so no manual build steps, SDL3 hunting, or Android SDK download are
 required.
 .
 This package vendors and builds the upstream scrcpy project
 (https://github.com/Genymobile/scrcpy), which is licensed under the
 Apache License 2.0 by Genymobile and contributors.
